msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques.\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) ialah pakej sambungan rasmi yang menyediakan algoritma dan teknik pengkomputeran kuantum yang khusus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials here {#tutorials-here}"
msgstr "Tutorial di sini {#tutorials-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width by cutting gates, and find cuts automatically |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Pakej | Penerangan |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Kurangkan lebar litar dengan memotong gate, dan cari potongan secara automatik |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's documentation no longer has guides for this addon, and no IBM tutorial covers these two. They come from the addon's GitHub repository and may be outdated. They can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "Dokumentasi IBM Quantum tidak lagi mempunyai panduan untuk addon ini, dan tiada tutorial IBM yang merangkumi kedua-dua ini. Kedua-duanya datang daripada repositori GitHub addon tersebut dan mungkin sudah lapuk. Ia boleh dilaksanakan terus dalam pelayar anda menggunakan Binder, atau pada pelayan Jupyter anda sendiri.\n"

